    "long_instructions": "To visualize your data, you first need to store it.\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n- Store your data to `data.csv`.\r\n- If you didn’t collect data, or have data that isn’t usable, consider using one of the other available datasets: `games.csv` or `sleep.csv`.\r\n  - `games.csv` contains data about how much people like video games and board games on a 1 (least) to 5 (most) scale.\r\n  - `sleep.csv` contains data on how many hours of sleep, and how many hours of homework, students reported.\r\n\r\n**💻 Coding Tip**\r\n\r\nRefer to the CSV documentation in your Project Planning Guide.\r\n",
